      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Cholargos enjoys cooler air than downtown Athens because it lies at the foot of Mount Hymettus, where cold mountain breezes settle.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        21
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cholargos",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Just a short drive away, the Acrocorinth fortress offers 360‑degree views of the Gulf of Corinth and the surrounding mountains.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1,
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://touristplaces.guide/cholargos-travel-guide-top-10-must-visit-tourist-places/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The Temple of Apollo in Cholargos, dating back to the classical period, showcases ancient Greek spiritual architecture.",
